# Paths sqlfluff should skip. Add any dynamically-assembled query here — one whose
# `{placeholder}` tokens are filled at runtime (not static, parseable SQL), so sqlfluff
# cannot template it. Example:
#   src/config/queries/sqlite/positions__{granularity}_rollup.sql
#
# Note the shape: queries are filed per ENGINE directory
# (src/config/queries/<engine>/<table>__<purpose>.sql), so an ignore entry names the engine
# folder too. Ignoring a bare filename would silently cover every engine's copy of it.
